{"id":"n91770-1-8","stage":1,"title":"주사 · 注射","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n91770-1-8-1","ko":"감기가 계속 안 떨어지네.","zh":"感冒怎么一直好不了啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"감기가","meaning":"感冒","explanation":"감기：感冒；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"감기","audio":"/audio/2c4cdf56b777f3677c17.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28635","senseId":"1","lemma":"감기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"계속","meaning":"继续，持续","explanation":"계속：继续，持续","readings":[{"term":"계속","audio":"/audio/23a9f0224cc40ec08adb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17692","senseId":"1","lemma":"계속","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"떨어지네.","meaning":"好转，痊愈，改掉","explanation":"떨어지다：好转，痊愈，改掉；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"떨어지다","audio":"/audio/5360fef914150d393574.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89796","senseId":"16","lemma":"떨어지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"2c4cdf56b777f367","term":"감기","zh":"感冒","audio":"/audio/2c4cdf56b777f3677c17.mp3","entryId":"28635","definition":"一般伴有咳嗽、流鼻涕、头痛、发冷等症状的传染病。","pronunciation":["감ː기"]},{"id":"23a9f0224cc40ec0","term":"계속","zh":"继续，持续","audio":"/audio/23a9f0224cc40ec08adb.mp3","entryId":"17692","definition":"连续不间断。","pronunciation":["계ː속","게ː속"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"5360fef914150d39","term":"떨어지다","zh":"好转，痊愈，改掉","audio":"/audio/5360fef914150d393574.mp3","entryId":"89796","definition":"病好转或改了老毛病。","pronunciation":["떠러지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/2213ffd1a7c1f2ee9356.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n91770-1-8-2","ko":"병원에 가서 주사 한 방 맞으면 금방 나을 텐데.","zh":"去医院打一针的话应该很快就能好起来的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","pa